{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1270,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4307b070adcef895513089cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没办法发挥平时的实力……\r\n这样我怎么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "102bf12922fd82c391dea788dcf641c8de094bdf4425a404f59bcb2435618f1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5856b37369e0f57872695314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我知道不能\r\n再裹足不前了，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b87b8d7cd50d10393e067c46c7c5f2ec61dae317f0012b517002b1cd94189361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2275828f6b09f656075998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我还跑得动，\r\n但太过勉强\r\n是会给肌肉造成负担的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "178b902898a20a8bb6b6ab233d24e775eacd4699a659fd1b0e8b6e67c0ef755f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da11a9871318507c33cc466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，再继续参加比赛的话，\r\n可能会对身体状况造成影响……",
      "source_fingerprint": "547e0bc8d5ccaac5e9d0e523522cf40f32e5db6e3b298022281fea7e4a8198af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec097acfce863a630638cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的股四头肌锻炼到绝佳的状态了！\r\n它感觉在催促我「快跑起来」呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f452a6a5bbd44e089f558bca48d687ac388d61092465bb741512b13e40fa5e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4d12e859a06f28bc9016cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我，无论遇到什么对手\r\n感觉都能赢……！\r\n你看我的腹肌群，这么硬梆梆的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "710af26dde3f2890b612a6b9e5b3030105e57baa8aaa81aa806530e8c9613e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3337bc1c2d2b300277fb504f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！！\r\n大腿后肌好像随时都要\r\n跑起来的感觉……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18773d09346aa1efc0f3c4d359d8da1dd6ce1ace807fb1c212ec0cfb6708d90b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca936bc2cd8c5b222d626fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉！干劲！\r\n全身的肌肉正在燃烧啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f3e5a799b0e62d5084c4cd53e523e855dea81ab67914af6a62ddb93ac762f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f81e99260944805037bf9c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的比目鱼肌说\r\n「今天可以尽情奔跑」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7abcb94491fbc84e6bef446433e99db103d12195ee425530ec8e83a32c668570",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a1967ed67f147bbe8b8f4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力和肌肉是不会背叛我的，\r\n我要向大家证明这一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7cc578be855d5d09aefddf40af585e780305cdf2cee10d9cb6ffeb0c8096234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de1b8bc725d08e0c610b6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要和训练员一起\r\n相信肌肉、继续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a94a1b76d2785bd0f551dde34bf9b6affa805a1114ef7605c6ea149bfcb22045",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d6e5ffa043ddfc8241b547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信一直以来的努力\r\n一定能让我跑出好成绩的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "645a7e37d7a66ad146c555f6a5336481d25df9299c4fb33ed5613c618e1cac50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7bc92888393417b51bfcf1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打算不慌不忙地像平常那样去跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f6b3b15d4ab829a9ab3cbec40535f748be0abfd52b88a36d7f6bd7a9300c4e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba882ed91dc901c6c12095a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然会感到不安，\r\n但只要开始比赛之后，就都不重要了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e530b98d644c57171ff07e02684c760ddb39fdd260c55025999632dc11b2d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91094f0a045d86e58151e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锻炼方式不太够吗……？\r\n……不对，比起在这边后悔，\r\n我应该专心思考眼前的问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c39e23fe07ce8855867a3f27f414910f9a34bf6fb27c97fe9fadc61d5cf08638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935016ce1cd4e689ae15a310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日积月累的努力造就了现在的我……\r\n所以我一定没问题的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bbcc89ed98fc96e9e810bce7940f1224fdb4fc73bb21b56124e3fdf3933672b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e3027b9a501358efe2fa34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要想起平时奔跑的感觉才行……\r\n要尽量跟平时一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a6783f9e057a8636515d32d0cd7e0927645ae18a960ae70802c4b6417fb9eb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237d9d4d8c4f58e608504f79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遇到问题就更该冷静应对……\r\n专注在跑步上吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef530e04d8d4f6f8c9ff8e1d4217a4fcf86758834b346ba69820a3a542202ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6458f2074dde643bfa74a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人在为我加油……！\r\n就算状态再不好，\r\n我也绝对不想输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a3e4ab7635aaa83918096e823b272354bb568d04f8e6dfe7c58fb7d6ef5f81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faad34f90251c9662a7d24fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed2ff5a4a8501cae0df0215",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec2d1c5e39ad06372919431b904049a4e39189d36cb9a69ebde122c825ec0ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c17f0662bb1dc6890ec83a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e6fab2e0ec9cf73b30d01ceed3d2a4d47ba84afae9cf0d8fda401785979920",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ba50330487c030d5ea17b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a048816601878f09a8951aadc34edf1f66b7cbb43bb1d5e45d6ee0ce85a4d890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458686d81fce7666910d071c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，噢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa09dcb28cb3aa881c3c7323462c4f6f2053b59033729770117e6923bdabcd8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2822159b5aabe532c13d9cac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇、奇怪……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce3cb13489d35794f75c3c08573b9d4945b875f8ba4de242b85011390d70aed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70dc7b4d419b5f25bebbead",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:295a800d6161cf027ad9bd01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想游泳喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e245db7942b4aacf2f1ca84c28706a81ccba65bbc684c62fbf8d0d5ccb73cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3f8f0a8f643458b3845310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记我们\r\n一起努力过的每一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270ca54242a31df632e97787ab153f21bcd90cf006a604e4a99304ce8f667ff1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c098cae979c2b2f66780d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78181d7abd84c3a061c42a49bc280cd76506f4c065b8afa69a10e097496add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12969b3587cd28dac254a804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，Let's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d263bba20db2fd461c358c86badfaa0356c9dac84a06fe9f184f7804664a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0866e24bc8965dcd75dab42b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前去取胜吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29dc95012dd6b46b651d819cb7a946b04dd5ada1a160ac35b52d11b7d681c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97429b2207a9e6e79038adc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们全力以赴吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83efa9aee0b6bc3aa6709d08370c1925cb731fd7d52326a7379965305c74e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8bbee30ec082b946274ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78181d7abd84c3a061c42a49bc280cd76506f4c065b8afa69a10e097496add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12ec58012cdfd177e5bd832d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力和肌肉是不会背叛我的，\r\n我要向大家证明这一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7cc578be855d5d09aefddf40af585e780305cdf2cee10d9cb6ffeb0c8096234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84febd66283bb7a5b532f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！！大腿后肌好像\r\n随时都要跑起来的感觉……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4f29d5c6ac5f48fb12d8feba685e8bd4c80306bff9e78e8923fd0846dc8db39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5243587d8e466151fb272306",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78181d7abd84c3a061c42a49bc280cd76506f4c065b8afa69a10e097496add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab08313204db51f004c6d2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "690c07cec6eb89141bc1d30c56b9875ef465bdb404721c965c822cd54bf6e7cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab320fec6f8dc4bc9a540b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……！就只差一点点而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1130ac745d10608414c259e5eddddbc1491351a555f3ac50fb1284dff336b34b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c1ca710ceffc1e8d30a10f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一点……还需要再更努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1041263396723c152e169d0fde7dedda2e0780efac97bcc8161606d52d75622c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbb01108a73dd7b9b577f0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不满意这样的结果……我要重新锻炼自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "605cdf43d848ea6bc15f3bc37b3684dd7e1173c48f1941ec1d827c0a5fc6faa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d12e702bb02583f6ff10a22d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然已经尽力了，\r\n但还是要好好反省……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3921be997995e6f74268d8d81ae12108d0ba4d50d1f3cc140c6e59831f67fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11cec254773173a78d0c4114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得好啊……肌肉！！我成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35790d7acb5e184bc413cca51ac8f6d7740b7425146d335f4ba70918abe837ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1707e9472a45a2eecd6160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵！因为我有好好锻炼嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb48bf2295481363d0f4f7c09d98010cb17e6e7ee930b75e3df957e2f78c515",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d27f97228fb3048d259d114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热腾腾的胜利滋味，是否合口味呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cfeb58b441d326b29e87dbeef5ed6be19c6a935dc34cf5488bedd89cf8a689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66af3130cda2a2362ec1c2a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵！因为我有好好锻炼嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb48bf2295481363d0f4f7c09d98010cb17e6e7ee930b75e3df957e2f78c515",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f720b1ba422dcea936c5573c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2bb6aa9296705d5102790693297130cf222498f74bde73e80f281cd154ae018",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2314661c160db85f7719c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哦哦！锻炼……肌肉！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "392fef713cb7e934b50ca4ad854330ac5f659771e45b6b36c3451d9615e562b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ff2bf2c0dafcd3b65635a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也快到情人节了啊……\r\n我原本一直觉得\r\n这个季节跟自己无关呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc865467409bb96a8c7a0466b202eb5e32905a26b5b7d5ea8154358772563a15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77da00e8b9e039aeb43542a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしの後ろをチョコチョコついて\r\nきてた2人が、大きくなって…\r\nって！素で出てくるんだ…この言葉",
      "source_fingerprint": "4535bbcf46ff03da402e777b9cd6de7aa87bb385087add63ddb0dbf20cc1036b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0dc50155509cb79b11c29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起尽情享受大赛，\r\n让大家都能展露笑容吧！\r\n当然也要拿下优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "581d557df2f87caa0b9cb737e84270aa1a12f590db544f8ac3536d6ec67b76b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502c7b83f6fdc0203a3847d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哦哦！锻炼……肌肉！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "392fef713cb7e934b50ca4ad854330ac5f659771e45b6b36c3451d9615e562b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a365e64df1541d2d77ecba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "找机会去让麦昆亲眼看看\r\n我这个发饰好了。\r\n……跟她炫耀说「可爱吧」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a67a8f1426f28e3efc92cbc8f25ff7dcfc03db4b75af4f6d162e3b33c1c1935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63bda334625fdb4e259ca5e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントはマフラーと耳カバー\r\nかぁ！使いやすいかわいさで…\r\nあたしの好みドストライク！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b4837eb099e9d4fe66a62c2a57e1deed81fe88403e9bbb864298cf3bc796fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:295a09fd4811c07ad4474911",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションはこちらです\r\n…クリスマス・ナイト用に、\r\nいろんな案内を練習したんです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e0f62391909938aa23597cf0b1341b0262efcbb76cba76aa393d755cedc6459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41b04fd41688fe45c4094f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご褒美はきちんともらいました？\r\nせっかく頑張ったんですから、\r\nもらい忘れないでくださいね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d792c95ffcff1b43181a14d9e39fd4d72a88e2dadbe5855dd542e8b8c7ad6cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6df04c6c48784941e0d90ed8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08564caef354816a1ac4cee115b99707d9adb78494d7857fa288494437b85c6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0064490302650b0acb2a0778",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "敬请品尝……最棒的胜利滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "635c532da54774fb5d538812e2c72c75a5c17a67ecde6513daf504beb2f6988c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ae83c8a59dabc5d6bda250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临。在本店可以品尝到……\r\n最棒的胜利滋味……请用！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed44d64b4eef6d900404ad6ee869b1c3295ebba01ff6bd5c8335d6eb088f682",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec654475473a8b6b5e970977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是自己在受人帮助，\r\n实在太不象样了……\r\n嗯，我也得改变才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c63a4c5bc7b2b6e955883283573c0304d0ebd864f4b401cf2e523f2831fef48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "400045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57873548b402f08fffc6b1dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a28870554c83424f396c8622ca63c1145245bdce94bc6d075587971b9541db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51463d80a65d554ff480b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やったぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0bdcfa8f27517c6588bc2641e6ed8b09df9b303ab3e349995840d998d8e2c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e1f6c7a71e461e8c62a0723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしっ",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afb727c5543bec49be9b7346d3b68dcebed6761e36b5294ff9b2b4a99063cda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
